    "perplexity": {
      "description": "All The Voices is a 10LP box set by INXS on Universal Music Group International, gathering the band’s key studio albums from their Hutchence-era output. It presents a broad survey of INXS’s evolution from early new-wave-influenced rock into the polished pop-rock sound that made them international stars, and it includes Elegantly Wasted on vinyl for the first time in this collection.\n\nThe set spans the self-titled debut through Elegantly Wasted, with each album packaged in replica artwork and remastered for the box. Its significance lies in bringing together the group’s most important recordings in one deluxe vinyl edition, making it both a comprehensive archive of their catalog and a showcase for the durability of their biggest albums and singles.",
